        "created_at": "2018-07-19T20:55:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi, if you double click on cards you will often get additional information in the top right corner.&nbsp;</p><p><span>Would it be possible to display how many hardware and software cards are in play if you double click on any of them?</span></p><p>If 9 hardware cards are in play and you have to count them and after that you have to check whether you would exceed your software card limit, it just isn‘t comfortable.&nbsp;</p>",
